Third-party components
----------------------

PacketEvents - https://github.com/retrooper/packetevents
    Copyright (C) retrooper and contributors
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.
    Not bundled: P2P declares it as a `provided` dependency and depends on the
    PacketEvents plugin being installed separately at runtime.

ProtocolLib - https://github.com/dmulloy2/ProtocolLib
    Copyright (C) dmulloy2, Comphenix and contributors
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.
    No ProtocolLib source code is included in this project. P2P independently
    re-implements ProtocolLib's public API surface (package, class and constant
    names) so that plugins compiled against ProtocolLib can link against P2P.
    The file src/generator/resources/protocollib-aliases.tsv is a mapping table
    of packet constant names, derived from ProtocolLib's public API declarations.
